OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly dry
OL,6,Fwith clear spells most widespread in
OL,7,Fthe east, but a few scattered light
OL,8,Fshowers appearing west and north of
OL,9,FLough Neagh. Southwest winds
OL,10,Ffreshening overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FMost in east staying dry
OL,13,Fwith best of the brighter spells
OL,14,Fappearing through the morning and
OL,15,Ftowards the east coast. Scattered
OL,16,Fshowers developing during the
OL,17,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
