OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,6,FUnsettled for Sunday with strong
OL,7,Fwinds, rain then showers. Most dry on
OL,8,FMonday with showers generally confined
OL,9,Fto the far west. Tuesday turning wet
OL,10,Fand windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
